<item>
            <title>[LU-18770] lfs mirror extend -N=&lt;count&gt; does not set mirror count correctly</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18770</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It does not count the existing mirror number correctly, since the raw layout format stores the actual (mirror_count - 1) in its mirror count field, so that plain or non-mirrored PFL file which has 0 in the mirror count field logically has 1 mirror in it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
